      en: ["Founded on January 13, 1537, by Spanish explorer Sebastián de Belalcázar.", "The city is located at an elevation of 1,737 meters (5,700 feet).", "The Holy Week processions have been held annually since 1556.", "A devastating earthquake struck the city on March 31, 1983.", "Popayán is the birthplace of 17 Colombian presidents and leaders.", "The Puente del Humilladero bridge was completed in 1873 to link the center."],
