      en: ["Founded on August 30, 1863, during the Colombian colonization period.", "Situated at an average elevation of 1,411 meters above sea level.", "Matecaña International Airport was largely built by community labor in 1944.", "The César Gaviria Trujillo Viaduct is 440 meters long.", "Has served as the capital of Risaralda since the department's creation in 1966.", "Los Nevados National Natural Park is located 40 km east of the city."],
