      en: ["The city was founded in 1771 as Nuestra Señora del Rosario.", "It hosted the 1821 Congress of Cúcuta, uniting Colombia, Ecuador, and Venezuela.", "General Francisco de Paula Santander was born here on April 2, 1792.", "The city sits at an elevation of approximately 320 meters above sea level.", "A devastating earthquake in 1875 reduced much of the original church to ruins.", "The Historical Park is a National Monument comprising several colonial buildings."],
      es: ["Cuna de la República Colombiana (Congreso de 1821).", "Lugar de nacimiento del héroe nacional General Francisco de Paula Santander.", "Hogar del Complejo Histórico Villa del Rosario.", "Situada directamente en el puente internacional Simón Bolívar hacia Venezuela.", "Fundada el 5 de agosto de 1761.", "Importante centro de comercio fronterizo en Norte de Santander.", "Alberga las ruinas de la capilla donde se firmó la primera constitución.", "Posee el museo 'Casa Natal del General Santander'."],
